            "ydü",
            "tü"
          ],
          "answer": "tü",
          "full": "Oda küçüktü.",
          "ru": "The room was small.",
          "explanation": "k is voiceless — t; the vowel ü — tü."
        },
        {
          "id": "6",
          "ctx": "You and your friends remember college. “You were students.”",
          "before": "Siz ",
          "word": "öğrenci",
          "after": ".",
          "opts": [
            "ydınız",
            "ydiniz",
            "diniz"
